. You'll have everything you need, from basic logic gates to sophisticated components, to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567620/extras/112c2de548891e8cd253d7a38ff3aac1.poster.avif?t=1763207171\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567620/extras/112c2de548891e8cd253d7a38ff3aac1.webm?t=1763207171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567620/extras/112c2de548891e8cd253d7a38ff3aac1.mp4?t=1763207171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into the fascinating universe of electronics and redefine what you know about puzzles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game simplifies electronics for easy fun, no expertise needed. It's not a precise circuit simulator but a series of puzzles meant to entertain and maybe spark an interest in electronics. Dive in and enjoy the challenges!</p>", "short_description": "Enter the most advanced challenge laboratory of today's games, where electronics and logic merge into challenges that will captivate your mind and awaken the engineer within you!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567620/header.jpg?t=1763207171", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763207171", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=176320